  "text": "Intake note (Commercial team, 15 June 2025). Our client Gaurav Pawar is a 67-year-old government clerk who lives at House No. 73, Koregaon Park, Pune 411012 and can be reached on +91 69625 03203 or gaurav.pawar@example.in. The client's PAN YUFPP2848M.\nThe client consulted us about a cheque bounce matter against M/s Sterling Traders. A cheque for ₹22,10,000 issued by M/s Sterling Traders bounced: the cheque was returned unpaid for insufficient funds.\nThe cheque was deposited in the client's account no. 822527743139 (IFSC KKBK0956267).\nThe matter was filed as S.C.C. No. 1770/2025 before the Judicial Magistrate First Class Court at Pune on 21 July 2025.",
